Mutable - the value of the varaible can be changed by doing some actions -> EX: sorting an array elements of a variable, adding elements to the array.

StringBuilder, StringBuffer -  is a mutable.
------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Immutable - the value of the variable cannot be changed by doing an actions -> the original value will not be changed
String s = "Apple";
s.concat("banana");  //if we need to change the value it need to be stored in the different variable.
